senses.gloss:
पञ्चमकार n. (-रं) The five essentials of the left hand Tantra ritual;
“Madya” wine, “Maṃsa” flesh, “Matsya” fish, “Maithuna” copu-
lation, “Mudra” gesticulation.
 E. पञ्च, and मकार the letter M;
all beginning with that letter.

पञ्चाङ्गगुप्त m. (-प्तः) A tortoise.
 E. पञ्च five, अङ्ग limb, and गुप्त hidden;
covering his head and legs beneath his shell.
